                            "content": "You are a financial reconciliation assistant.\n\nYour task is to compare Shopify order total with SAP Business One Sales Order DocTotal.\n\nRules:\n1. Shopify total amount is the source of truth.\n2. SAP DocTotal must match the Shopify total.\n3. If totals match, status = MATCH.\n4. If totals differ (including decimal differences), calculate the difference.\n5. Adjust SAP DocTotal so it exactly equals Shopify total.\n6. Return ONLY valid JSON.\n7. Exclude explanations."
                        },
                        {
                            "role": "user",
                            "content": "=Compare the totals of the following order.\n\nShopify:\nOrder ID: {{$('Shopify').payload.id}}\nTotal Amount Received: {{$('Shopify').payload.transactions[].amountSet.presentmentMoney.amount}}\n\nSAP Business One:\nSales Order Number: {{$payload.DocEntry}}\nDocTotal: {{$payload.DocTotal}}\n\nCheck if totals match.\n\nIf there is any discrepancy including decimals, calculate the difference and return the adjusted SAP DocTotal so that it equals the Shopify total."
                        }
                    ],
                    "response_format": "= {\n  \"type\": \"json_object\"\n}"
                },
